# Large downloaded datasets — the loader re-downloads them on demand.
# The DERIVED, committed artefacts (marker matrices, downsampling tables)
# live in python/data/ and are NOT ignored: they are what makes the
# real-data figures reproducible without a 100 MB download.
python/data/raw/
*.h5ad
*.h5
*.mtx
*.tar.gz

# NOTE: figures/ is deliberately NOT ignored — generated figures are course
# deliverables and are committed alongside the code and seeds that made them.
# NOTE: python/data/beads/ is NOT ignored — the bead tallies are primary data.
